  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced African &amp; Arab capacities in combating human trafficking and smuggling of migrants.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">11.	The efficient response to human trafficking and smuggling of migrants in Africa requires a comprehensive and holistic approach that involves various stakeholders. This brings about the need for knowledge, skills and frameworks that enable the African countries to prevent and combat both crimes, protect victims, prosecute perpetrators and allow for regional and international cooperation. From September 2019 till March 2022, in the framework of the completed project &#x201c;Enhancing Peace, Security</narrative>
  </description>
